<title>ESTONIA: PENNU SHARE CAPITAL INCREASE FINISHED.</title>
<headline>PENNU SHARE CAPITAL INCREASE FINISHED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennu Computer Technology's share capital increase to 16 million kroons has been completed, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The capital increase of 136,000 shares has been entered into the business register, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 6300 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
